e"}}, {"id": 324819, "date": 1645056000, "platform": 6, "y": 2022, "release_region": {"id": 8, "region": "worldwide"}}, {"id": 324820, "date": 1645056000, "platform": 3, "y": 2022, "release_region": {"id": 8, "region": "worldwide"}}], "screenshots": [{"id": 606130, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scczoy.jpg"}, {"id": 606139, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scczp7.jpg"}, {"id": 606135, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scczp3.jpg"}, {"id": 606141, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scczp9.jpg"}, {"id": 606138, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scczp6.jpg"}, {"id": 606137, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scczp5.jpg"}, {"id": 606132, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scczp0.jpg"}, {"id": 606133, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scczp1.jpg"}], "slug": "total-war-warhammer-iii", "storyline": "Far beyond the world and its petty wars there exists a dimension of pure, malevolent magic: The Realm of Chaos. It is a terrible place, incomprehensible to the mortal mind. It whispers promises of power, but to behold it is to be seduced by it. To relinquish your soul to it. To become it.\n\nThe four Ruinous Powers rule over this place, ever seeking to slip their bonds and engulf the world in a tide of daemonic corruption. Nurgle, the plague god; Slaanesh, the lord of excess; Tzeentch, the changer of ways; and Khorne, the god of blood and slaughter.\n\nOn the border between the worlds, two mighty kingdoms stand sentinel: the stern warriors of Kislev and the vast empire of Grand Cathay. But each is beset by its own trials, and now both have cause to cross the threshold and send their armies into the Realm of Chaos.\n\nThe world stands on a precipice. A single push will plunge it into cataclysm.\n\nAnd there is one who schemes to achieve just that, an ancient figure who desires nothing less than to wield supreme power. But to succeed, he will need a champion\u2026\n\nThe coming conflict will engulf all. Will you conquer your daemons? Or command them?", "summary": "The cataclysmic conclusion to the Total War: Warhammer trilogy is coming. Rally your forces and step into the Realm of Chaos, a dimension of mind-bending horror where the very fate of the world will be decided. Will you conquer your Daemons or command them?", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 39, "name": "Warfare"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/total-war-warhammer-iii", "videos": [{"id": 54752, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "033FWxL22A0", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=033FWxL22A0", "title": "The Dawn of Grand Cathay | Total War: WARHAMMER III", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/033FWxL22A0/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 45204, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "HAr7yUlM0Po", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HAr7yUlM0Po", "title": "Total War: WARHAMMER III Announce Trailer - Conquer Your Daemons | Coming 2022", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/HAr7yUlM0Po/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 114182, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "G2NDDhUp8kI", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=G2NDDhUp8kI", "title": "Total War: WARHAMMER III - Karanak Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/G2NDDhUp8kI/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 2651, "name": "Total War: Warhammer"}]}